//RS 
//RS /// `jet self devtools reduce <file.jet> [--code EXXXX]`.
//RS ///
//RS /// Oracle (what makes a candidate "still interesting"):
//RS ///   - default: the front end accepts the file AND rustc rejects the
//RS ///     generated Rust (an I2 repro — invariant I2 says this must never
//RS ///     happen in a shipped compiler, so a minimal repro is worth having);
//RS ///   - `--code EXXXX`: the front end emits diagnostic `EXXXX` (from either
//RS ///     an error result or a lint on a successful compile).
