//RS /// Whether `src` still triggers the target oracle. `code`: `None` = default
//RS /// I2 oracle (front end accepts, rustc rejects); `Some(code)` = the front end
//RS /// emits that diagnostic code (error or lint). Writes `src` to `scratch`
