//RS /// Simplified Zeller ddmin over line-chunks: repeatedly try removing a
//RS /// contiguous chunk of the current granularity; on any removal that keeps the
//RS /// oracle interesting, keep the shrunk version and tighten the granularity;
//RS /// on a full pass with no progress, double the chunk count (finer chunks)
//RS /// until we're at single-line granularity, then stop.
